--- x_070/gxemul-0.7.0/HISTORY	2021-04-22 13:04:13.000000000 -0500
+++ x_trunk/gxemul-trunk/HISTORY	2023-07-28 11:46:38.000000000 -0500
@@ -5052,3 +5052,33 @@
 
 ==============  RELEASE 0.7.0  ==============
 
+20210426	Adding disassembly of 88K "tcnd", and treating tcnd ne0,r0,x
+		as a nop (since r0 is always zero).
+20210427	Refactoring of the breakpoint handling code; moving towards
+		subsystem breakpoints. (So far, -T is implemented as a
+		breakpoint for the "memory" subsytem.)
+20210428	Implementing 88K word and byte memset loops (used by the
+		OpenBSD/luna88k kernel and userland, respectively).
+20210429	Applying a patch from Kenji Aoyama for calculating LUNA-88K
+		FUSE ROM checksum.
+20210504	More refactoring of breakpoints: internal support for printing
+		instead of breaking, hits are now counted, CTRL-T prints
+		breakpoint status etc. (No way to interactively configure all
+		settings yet, though.)
+20210506	Improved SMP stability by making sure to invalidate code
+		translations for _all_ CPUs on memory writes, not just for the
+		CPU doing the write.
+20210523	Unimplemented MIPS regimm instructions now cause a Reserved
+		Instruction exception.
+20210829	The ARM "permanently undefined" instructions now result in an
+		und exception (patch from Nick Hudson).
+20210830	Fix for ARM carry flag update for some instructions (patch
+		from Nick Hudson). Also updating the NetBSD/cats installation
+		instructions to 9.2.
+20230724	Going through recent commits and cleaning up temporary hacks.
+		Updating NetBSD/pmax install instructions to 9.3.
+20230725	Updating NetBSD/hpcmips install instructions to 9.3.
+		Updating NetBSD/evbmips (Malta) install instructions to 9.3.
+20230726	Updating OpenBSD/luna88k install instructions to 7.3.
+20230728	Updating NetBSD/dreamcast test instructions to 9.3.
+		Updating NetBSD/arc install instructions to 9.3.
